	(text "All stages connect only through global power symbols (+48V, +12V, +3V3, +3.3VADC, GNDD, GNDA).\nPWM_EN_IN / PWM_EN_RTN (J501 pins 3 and 4) leave this tree as hierarchical labels to the optocoupler on the interfaces sheet."
